\section{Thermal and Structural Dynamics}

\subsection{Power Dissipation and Thermal Equilibrium}
Steady-state full-load power:
\[
P_{\text{diss}} = \SI{1.85}{\kilo\watt}.
\]
Core casing temperature:
\[
\Delta T_{\max} = +\SI{18.4}{\celsius} \text{ above ambient } (\SI{22.0}{\celsius}),
\]
with active fluid-assisted cooling via internal chassis channels.

\subsection{Strain and Deformation}
Measured axial strain across the \SI{1250}{\milli\meter} frame:
\[
\varepsilon = 1.2\times10^{-6},
\]
